       "id": "18463091"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Proteolytically cleaved at the tripeptide Xaa-Pro-Gln, where Xaa in the P(3) position is mostly lysine. The endoprotease may be of microbial origin"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "PTM"
  },
